<title>USA: Calif. $34 mln health bonds repriced, yields cut.</title>
<headline>Calif. $34 mln health bonds repriced, yields cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said Thursday it repriced $34.1 million California Health Facilities Financing Authority bonds, for Catholic Healthcare West, lowering yields in several maturities and cutting the top yield in 2023 to 5.62 percent from 5.65 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>CALIFORNIA HEALTH FACILITIES FINANCING AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $34,135,000*</p>
<p>INSURED REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>(CATHOLIC HEALTHCARE WEST)</p>
<p>1996 SERIES E</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
