<p>	     UNDERLYING:A1     UNDERLYING: A+    UNDERLYING: A+</p>
<p>AMBAC INSURED</p>
<p>  DATED: 11/01/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 07/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 07/01</p>
